{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract"]]},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"How to add the package as dependency, import libraries and use theme and components for your apps.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Getting Started with MISO","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png"},{"type":"card","identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png"}],"modules":[{"name":"Welcome to MISO"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Essentials","generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Tokens","doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Themes","doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Components","doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Modules"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Integrate MISO","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Integrate-MISO"},{"text":"Use Swift Package Manager","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Use-Swift-Package-Manager"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you want to add the iOS library of ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MISO"}]},{"text":", you need to add our ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}]},{"text":" into your project.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To do that, add a new ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"package dependency"}]},{"text":" to your ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Xcode"}]},{"text":" project by refering to it by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/miso-ios"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You are free to choose whether or not you want a branch or a specific tag, pick the solution you want.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/miso-ios\/wiki\/50-%E2%80%90-About-versions,-releases-and-builds"},{"text":" for more details about versions, releases and tags. You can find release tags (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.0.0"}]},{"text":") and release candidates tags (e.g. ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"1.0.0-rc3"}]},{"text":").","type":"text"}]},{"text":"Import the libraries you need","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Import-the-libraries-you-need"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You should use one (or several) of the following imports for your needs, which are basically ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}]},{"text":" products.","type":"text"}]},{"name":"Tip","style":"tip","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"We recommend to embed in your apps only the ones you need to avoid to embed useless assets."}]}]},{"code":["import MISOThemesContract \/\/ If you want to define your theme, use themes or MISOThemeableView","import MISOModules \/\/ To use modules","import MISOComponents \/\/ To use components","import MISOThemesMISOBlueCoat \/\/ To use the BlueCoat theme","import MISOTokensComponent \/\/ If you need to override or use directly components tokens","import MISOTokenSemantic \/\/ If you need to override or use directly semantic tokens","import MISOTokensRaw \/\/ If you need to override or use directly raw tokens","import MISOFoundations \/\/ For some utilities"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"Or more simple, import umbrella library","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Or-more-simple-import-umbrella-library"},{"name":"Note","style":"note","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"We do not recommend this solution because from our point of view use of tailored imports is better to import only the needed elements."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use of umbrella products can increase app sizes and needed storage because it emebds plenty of assets (images, fonts, etc.)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and useless constants."}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Import the ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Swift Package"}]},{"text":" product which suits your needs:","type":"text"}]},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Umbrella"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MISOSwiftUI"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All libraries listed above and the BlueCoat theme"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MISOSwiftUIBlueCoat"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All libraries listed above but with only BlueCoat theme"}]}]]],"type":"table"},{"text":"Chose your theme","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Chose-your-theme"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"MISO"}]},{"text":" framework provides today one theme:","type":"text"}]},{"header":"row","rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Theme"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Description"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"BlueCoat"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For mockups, prototypes and prooves of concepts without any brand-flavoured styles"}]}]]],"type":"table"},{"text":"Apply a theme","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Apply-a-theme"},{"type":"row","columns":[{"size":1,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You will need to use for your application root view the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This special view is here to define some elements as environment variables and injects the choosen theme."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"size":1,"content":[{"type":"codeListing","code":["@main","struct YourApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","       WindowGroup {","          MISOThemeableView(theme: BlueCoatTheme()) {","                \/\/ Your root view","          }","       }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"}]}],"numberOfColumns":2},{"type":"row","columns":[{"size":1,"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Then get the current applied theme in your views and use the tokens you want."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The tokens are wrapped in providers with clear names, you only need to choose the ones you want."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"size":1,"content":[{"type":"codeListing","code":["\/\/ Use it in views as an environment variable","@Environment(\\.theme) var theme"],"syntax":"swift"}]}],"numberOfColumns":2},{"name":"Tip","style":"tip","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keep in mind only one theme can be used within one "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"text":"Trick for Xcode Preview","type":"heading","level":3,"anchor":"Trick-for-Xcode-Preview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If you use Xcode ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"#Preview"},{"text":" blocks, you will have to be sure the theme is instanciated and injected through the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOThemeableView"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Because it is not possible today to override the legit ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"#Preview"},{"text":" block, you can instead use some of our utilities to wrap your content","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"inside the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOThemeableView"},{"text":" automatically. These utilities come with the themes modules. Without them you may face errors about undefined theme.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["\/\/ Apply BlueCoat theme","#Preview {","    SampleView()","        .blueCoatPreview()","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/GettingStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misothemescontract\/gettingstarted"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"article","references":{"doc://MISOThemesContract/documentation/MISOThemesContract/Tokens":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Design tokens represent the small, repeated design decisions that make up a design system’s visual style. Tokens wrap hard-coded static values, such as hexadecimal codes for color, with self-explanatory names. They are used to define the look and feel and the style of everything. They are exposed through the themes and can be used as they are."}],"title":"Tokens","url":"\/documentation\/misothemescontract\/tokens","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Tokens","images":[{"identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png","type":"icon"},{"identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png","type":"card"}],"role":"article","kind":"article"},"doc://MISOThemesContract/documentation/MISOThemesContract":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/misothemescontract","title":"Welcome to MISO","images":[{"identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png","type":"icon"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"🐙🍜 MISO is a library of SwiftUI components (forked from "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"), themes and tools for iOS app development."}],"role":"collection"},"ic_logo_miso.png":{"identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png","variants":[{"url":"\/images\/MISOThemesContract\/ic_logo_miso.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image","alt":null},"doc://MISOThemesContract/documentation/MISOThemesContract/Themes":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Themes","title":"Themes","abstract":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Themes","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" are applications of specific values for "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"components tokens","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"semantic tokens","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" using in the end "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"raw tokens","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":".(thus final usable low level values)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"theme","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" contains any relevant tokens which can be used for components rendering."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"theme","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" can use its own assets like fonts and icons."}],"url":"\/documentation\/misothemescontract\/themes","role":"article","type":"topic","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png"},{"type":"card","identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png"}],"kind":"article"},"doc://MISOThemesContract/documentation/MISOThemesContract/Components":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Components"}]},{"type":"text","text":" are the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" objects you can add in the views of your apps, like buttons, links, cards etc."}],"title":"Components","url":"\/documentation\/misothemescontract\/components","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Components","images":[{"identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png","type":"icon"},{"identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png","type":"card"}],"role":"article","kind":"article"},"doc://MISOThemesContract/documentation/MISOThemesContract/Modules":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"module"}]},{"type":"text","text":" can be seen as a set of features and components to fill a need."}],"title":"Modules","url":"\/documentation\/misothemescontract\/modules","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOThemesContract\/documentation\/MISOThemesContract\/Modules","images":[{"identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png","type":"icon"},{"identifier":"ic_logo_miso.png","type":"card"}],"role":"article","kind":"article"},"https://github.com/Orange-OpenSource/miso-ios/wiki/50-%E2%80%90-About-versions,-releases-and-builds":{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/miso-ios\/wiki\/50-%E2%80%90-About-versions,-releases-and-builds","title":"refer to the wiki","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"refer to the wiki","type":"text"}],"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/miso-ios\/wiki\/50-%E2%80%90-About-versions,-releases-and-builds","type":"link"},"https://github.com/Orange-OpenSource/ouds-ios":{"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios","title":"ouds-ios","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"ouds-ios","type":"text"}],"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Orange-OpenSource\/ouds-ios","type":"link"}}}